/- **def** `SuFunctor.Adequacy.stepC` — module `SuFunctor.Adequacy.Dtmc`.
The step-`t` kernel-consistency constraint: refining a prefix
cylinder by its next observation multiplies its probability by the
stored outcome row. 
-/
noncomputable def LeanCone.«SuFunctor.Adequacy.stepC» :
    {S : Type} →
      SuFunctor.Adequacy.DtmcRows S →
        (k : ℕ) → Fin k → SuFunctor.SubPMF (SuFunctor.Adequacy.Traj S k) → Prop :=
  fun {S} R k t μ =>
    ∀ (ω : SuFunctor.Adequacy.Traj S k),
      μ.prob (SuFunctor.Adequacy.cyl (↑t + 1) ω) =
        μ.prob (SuFunctor.Adequacy.cyl (↑t) ω) * R.outcome (ω t.castSucc, ω t.succ)

